  "scope": "Dev-only reference adapter and conformance fixtures: current projection upsert, same-key original receipt retention, holder isolation, monotonic-version refusal. 15 integration functions per compiler and zero doctest examples.",
  "limitations": [
    "Two commits per retained history; independent fixture helper deliberately rejects deeper chains.",
    "Same-key overwrite fixture is unique asset mint then transfer; holder fixture is two balance.create operations for different subjects. This is not exhaustive profile, batch or arbitrary history coverage.",
    "Equal-version test deliberately supplies invalid storage input and checks committed effects; it does not claim a rolled-back pending reservation or full ingress acceptance.",
    "No batch retention/rebuild, interrupted/corrupt replay, physical backend reopen, power-loss, full F5/F8 or release qualification.",
    "No root workspace requalification or new production performance result; root crates, manifests, lockfile and fuzz unchanged."
  ],
  "negative_controls": {
